        "t": "text",
        "v": "Invoices use a third role, invoice-from for a supplier or invoice-to for a customer, and payments a fourth, pay-to or pay-by. Those belong to a financial company. If you work in a company that does only logistics, LN won't make them there, so you change to the financial company first and back afterwards."
      }
